# NotFair Directory skill resolver

Match the user's intent to the skill descriptions in the entry points below.
Read the selected `SKILL.md` and its canonical `WORKFLOW.md` before proceeding.
Use [the MCP connection guide](docs/mcp-connection.md) and current live schemas
for connected work. Read [the safety rules](docs/safety.md).

This release uses connectors and public or supplied evidence. Local CMS setup,
Gemini CLI review, helper installation, and shell-based updates are not included.
Do not download or run omitted helpers. Do not claim unavailable account access.

